R-CH8 R-CH9 R-C7 R-NS4 (slice 240, Design Q615 item 5): `min-release-age` (2 days, TALON_NOW 2026-11-10T12:00:00Z) uses the `published_at` of the release. The newest build `reify-2026-11-09-5555555` is 1 day old and is hidden for the bare name: `tln roc install reify --yes` installs `reify-2026-11-03-1708298`. An id names the compiler (R-NS4): `tln roc install reify-2026-11-09-5555555 --yes` installs the young build. Both builds are pinned in compat.tsv at the first list.
